<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>EcoWatt — Smart Energy. Real Savings. Greener Future.</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    :root {
      --bg-dark: #0f0520;
      --bg-section: #1a0a2e;
      --bg-card: #2d1b4e;
      --magenta: #d946ef;
      --magenta-dark: #a21caf;
      --magenta-glow: rgba(217, 70, 239, 0.25);
      --purple-light: #c4b5fd;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --white-muted: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
      --white-dim: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg-dark);
      color: var(--white);
      overflow-x: hidden;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    .glow-orb {
      position: fixed;
      border-radius: 50%;
      filter: blur(120px);
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
    }
    .glow-orb-1 {
      width: 500px; height: 500px;
      background: var(--magenta-glow);
      top: -100px; right: -100px;
    }
    .glow-orb-2 {
      width: 400px; height: 400px;
      background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15);
      bottom: 200px; left: -100px;
    }

    nav {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      padding: 20px 40px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      background: rgba(15, 5, 32, 0.85);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    }
    .nav-logo {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
      font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none; color: var(--white);
    }
    .nav-logo .spark { color: var(--magenta); font-size: 18px; }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 32px; align-items: center; }
    .nav-links a {
      color: var(--white-muted); text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--white); }
    .nav-cta {
      background: var(--magenta) !important;
      color: var(--white) !important;
      padding: 10px 22px !important;
      border-radius: 50px !important;
      font-weight: 600 !important;
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s !important;
      cursor: pointer !important;
    }
    .nav-cta:hover {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 30px var(--magenta-glow);
    }

    .hero {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 140px 24px 80px;
    }
    .hero-content { max-width: 720px; }
    .hero-badge {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid rgba(217, 70, 239, 0.3);
      padding: 8px 18px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--purple-light);
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .hero-badge .dot {
      width: 8px; height: 8px;
      background: #22c55e;
      border-radius: 50%;
      animation: pulse 2s infinite;
    }
    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
      50% { opacity: 0.4; }
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(36px, 6vw, 64px);
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }
    .hero h1 .highlight {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--magenta), var(--purple-light));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
    }
    .hero p {
      font-size: 18px;
      color: var(--white-muted);
      line-height: 1.7;
      max-width: 540px;
      margin: 0 auto 40px;
    }
    .hero-buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      background: var(--magenta);
      color: var(--white);
      padding: 16px 32px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
      border: none; cursor: pointer;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 40px var(--magenta-glow);
    }
    .btn-secondary {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--white);
      padding: 16px 32px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 500;
      text-decoration: none;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-secondary:hover {
      border-color: var(--magenta);
      background: rgba(217, 70, 239, 0.08);
    }

    .stats-bar {
      position: relative; z-index: 1;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 60px;
      padding: 40px 24px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .stat { text-align: center; }
    .stat-number {
      font-size: 36px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--magenta);
    }
    .stat-label {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--white-dim);
      margin-top: 4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    section {
      position: relative; z-index: 1;
      padding: 100px 24px;
    }
    .section-inner {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .section-eyebrow {
      font-size: 12px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      color: var(--magenta);
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .section-title {
      font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 42px);
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }
    .section-subtitle {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: var(--white-muted);
      line-height: 1.7;
      max-width: 560px;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .features-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .feature-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 32px 28px;
      transition: transform 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
    }
    .feature-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      border-color: rgba(217, 70, 239, 0.3);
    }
    .feature-icon {
      width: 52px; height: 52px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--magenta), var(--magenta-dark));
      border-radius: 14px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .feature-card h3 {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .feature-card p {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--white-muted);
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .how-it-works { background: var(--bg-section); }
    .steps-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .step-card {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 32px 20px;
    }
    .step-number {
      width: 56px; height: 56px;
      background: var(--magenta);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
    }
    .step-card h3 {
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .step-card p {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--white-muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .trust-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .trust-card {
      background: var(--magenta);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 28px 24px;
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .trust-icon {
      width: 44px; height: 44px;
      min-width: 44px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 20px;
    }
    .trust-card h3 {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .trust-card p {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .cta-section {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 100px 24px 120px;
    }
    .cta-box {
      max-width: 640px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid rgba(217, 70, 239, 0.2);
      border-radius: 28px;
      padding: 60px 40px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .cta-box::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: -80px; right: -80px;
      width: 200px; height: 200px;
      background: var(--magenta-glow);
      border-radius: 50%;
      filter: blur(60px);
    }
    .cta-box h2 {
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      position: relative;
    }
    .cta-box p {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: var(--white-muted);
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      position: relative;
    }
    .cta-box .btn-primary { position: relative; }

    footer {
      position: relative; z-index: 1;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      padding: 40px 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .footer-logo {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .footer-logo .spark { color: var(--magenta); }
    .footer-tagline {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--white-dim);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .footer-sdg {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      border-radius: 50px;
      padding: 8px 18px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--purple-light);
    }
    .footer-copy {
      margin-top: 24px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--white-dim);
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      nav { padding: 16px 20px; }
      .nav-links { display: none; }
      .stats-bar { gap: 30px; }
      .stat-number { font-size: 28px; }
      .cta-box { padding: 40px 24px; }
      section { padding: 70px 20px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="glow-orb glow-orb-1"></div>
  <div class="glow-orb glow-orb-2"></div>

  <nav>
    <a href="#" class="nav-logo">
      <span class="spark">✦</span> EcoWatt
    </a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#features">Features</a>
      <a href="#how-it-works">How It Works</a>
      <a href="#why-ecowatt">Why EcoWatt</a>
      <a href="#" class="nav-cta" onclick="openChat(); return false;">Try EcoWatt Free</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="hero-badge">
        <span class="dot"></span>
        AI-Powered Energy Audit — SDG 7
      </div>
      <h1>What if your home could tell you where your <span class="highlight">money is going?</span></h1>
      <p>EcoWatt is an AI-powered energy audit assistant that analyses your electricity usage, reads your actual bill, and delivers a personalised report with real savings tips — straight to your inbox.</p>
      <div class="hero-buttons">
        <a href="#" class="btn-primary" onclick="openChat(); return false;">
          💬 Chat with EcoWatt
        </a>
        <a href="#how-it-works" class="btn-secondary">
          See How It Works ↓
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="stats-bar">
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-number">50+</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Households Audited</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-number">SGD 25K+</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Bills Analysed</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-number">5</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Regions Supported</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-number">100%</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Free to Use</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section id="features">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">Features</div>
      <div class="section-title">Everything you need to understand your energy bill</div>
      <div class="section-subtitle">No technical knowledge required. Just chat, upload your bill if you want, and get a personalised report in minutes.</div>
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
          <h3>Appliance-Level Breakdown</h3>
          <p>See exactly how much each appliance costs you per month — from your air conditioner to your rice cooker — ranked by energy consumption.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">📄</div>
          <h3>Bill PDF Upload</h3>
          <p>Upload your actual electricity bill as a PDF and let our AI extract the real numbers — no more guessing your tariff rate or kWh usage.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🌱</div>
          <h3>CO₂ Footprint Estimate</h3>
          <p>Understand your household's carbon impact and see how it compares to the average home in your region.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">💡</div>
          <h3>Personalised Savings Tips</h3>
          <p>Get specific, actionable recommendations based on your actual appliances and usage — not generic advice you've heard before.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">☀️</div>
          <h3>Clean Energy Guidance</h3>
          <p>Discover renewable energy options and real government programmes available in your region, with estimated costs and payback periods.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">📊</div>
          <h3>PDF Report + Email Delivery</h3>
          <p>Receive a professionally formatted report in your inbox with a downloadable PDF you can save, print, or share with your family.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="how-it-works" id="how-it-works">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">How It Works</div>
      <div class="section-title">Three steps to a smarter energy bill</div>
      <div class="section-subtitle">The whole process takes about 3 minutes. No sign-up required.</div>
      <div class="steps-grid">
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-number">1</div>
          <h3>Chat with EcoWatt</h3>
          <p>Tell our AI assistant about your home — how many people live there, what appliances you use, and how many hours you run your AC.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-number">2</div>
          <h3>Upload Your Bill (Optional)</h3>
          <p>For a more accurate analysis, upload your electricity bill as a PDF. Our AI reads the actual numbers directly from the document.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-number">3</div>
          <h3>Get Your Report</h3>
          <p>Receive a personalised energy audit report in your email within minutes — with a PDF attached for your records.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="why-ecowatt">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">Why EcoWatt</div>
      <div class="section-title">Built to help, not to sell</div>
      <div class="section-subtitle">EcoWatt is a student-built project supporting UN Sustainable Development Goal 7: Affordable and Clean Energy.</div>
      <div class="trust-grid">
        <div class="trust-card">
          <div class="trust-icon">🔒</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Privacy First</h3>
            <p>Your bill is only used to extract numbers — never stored, never shared. The upload is completely optional.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-card">
          <div class="trust-icon">🎯</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Specific, Not Generic</h3>
            <p>Every tip references your actual appliances and usage hours. No more "turn off the lights" advice.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-card">
          <div class="trust-icon">🌏</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Region-Aware</h3>
            <p>Recommendations cite real programmes like HDB SolarNova, NEA rebates, and local tariff rates for your country.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-card">
          <div class="trust-icon">📈</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Real Impact Dashboard</h3>
            <p>Every audit contributes to a public dashboard tracking aggregate energy savings and SDG 7 progress.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-card">
          <div class="trust-icon">🤖</div>
          <div>
            <h3>AI-Powered Accuracy</h3>
            <p>RAG-augmented generation ensures recommendations are grounded in verified, up-to-date regional energy data.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-card">
          <div class="trust-icon">💰</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Completely Free</h3>
            <p>No sign-up, no paywall, no hidden costs. Built as a public good for affordable energy literacy.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="cta-box">
      <h2>Ready to lower your bill?</h2>
      <p>Chat with EcoWatt now and get your free personalised energy audit report delivered to your inbox in minutes.</p>
      <a href="#" class="btn-primary" onclick="openChat(); return false;">
        💬 Start Your Free Audit
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <div class="footer-logo">
      <span class="spark">✦</span> EcoWatt
    </div>
    <div class="footer-tagline">Smart Energy. Real Savings. Greener Future.</div>
    <div class="footer-sdg">🌍 Supporting UN SDG 7 — Affordable and Clean Energy</div>
    <div class="footer-copy">© 2026 EcoWatt. Built by IT students for a cleaner tomorrow.</div>
  </footer>

  <!-- Botpress Chatbot Embed -->
  <script src="https://cdn.botpress.cloud/webchat/v3.6/inject.js"></script>
